      "id": 1,
      "text": "Garland began as Mullingar, named after an Irish settler, then renamed Garland by Reverend J. McMaster around 1854 for its scenic beauty.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
